      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, i'll keep an eye on the moisture and decay. besides the obvious stuff like rot or bugs, do you know if there's anything else that can just... show up unexpectedly after the build is done? like, stuff that might compromise the integrity of the beam from the inside or in ways that aren't immediately obvious during the initial inspection?",
